This is a bit unfortunate--you're stuck with the shield for reflection
instead of being able to twoweapon.  A twoweaponing valk is an absolute
steamroller, and killing off tough monsters earlier means that they
don't even get the _chance_ to attack on those turns.

If it were me I'd swap it out for an amulet of reflection, but I
suspect that's a bad idea in your case--you say you're not completely
spoiled, so the "oLS gives you some protection against previously
unseen issues.  So your next option is to try to make some SDSM and
find a cloak of magic resistance--keep the robe for casting identify
(in a closet!  you're taking off your MR for it!).  With the early wand
of wishing I would've gone for MR from the Eye and reflection from
SDSM.

