I'm trying to figure out what the first one went for--GDSM and
brilliance are the two things I can see that are wish-worthy, I'm
guessing you went for reflection as well so that's 3 (in the future
avoid the shield for spellcasting or twoweaponing classes); if it was
0:1 that should still leave you the wrest charge after the ?charging.

At any rate, a magic marker is well worth a wish, your AC could use
some help.  Definitely keep 1 non-wrest wish for emergencies unless you
_need_ it for something.

